e":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"88676","synopsis":"高校生・ケンタは、恋人・ハルカを海に現れた奇獣に連れ去られてしまう。以来、奇獣を激しく憎みハルカの敵討ちを誓うケンタ。一方、村を訪れた番場は海洋学者・水崎から驚愕の事実を知らされる…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jp9IzEGn9Uyzc8Fuvrt2zCtZ5kM.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88677","synopsis":"小学生のシュンとユウタは、失くしたドローンを探して下水道を探検中、奇獣に出くわしてしまう。調査で町にいた番場は、襲われる二人を発見し脱出を試みるが…。製薬会社のエージェント・木村に救われる番場たち、彼らの目的とは…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8pmN75zw0bW8M5vOdP4Nqgoj8cS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88678","synopsis":"深夜のコンビニ。店員のレンは、先輩サイトウにこき使われる怠惰な日々を送っていた。しかし、突然店内にこだまする悲鳴により日常が一変する。レンとサイトウ、偶然居合わせた女子高生アユミを襲ったものとは…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p6IYjCQKNrATgUzuVQEqf63sbb1.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88679","synopsis":"番場は奇獣調査のため、観光船に乗り南極を訪れていた。そんな中、深海にいた潜水艇に事故が発生。番場は乗客のヨウスケとチアキの救出に協力するが、深海に潜む魔物を目撃することに…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/69HJTbEe0KLwyWLP8aayPMLRKuh.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88680","synopsis":"田舎のとある小学校。放課後、カズトとミノリは残って遊んでいた。教師ハルコが見咎め、二人を下校させるつもりだったが…。地震と共にグラウンドに突如現れたのは…!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8z8xX3PRXOYE4Sqb1fdErGSQctC.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"88681","synopsis":"かつての恋人サオリと奇獣の調査に向かう番場。しかし道中、トンネルの崩落事故に巻き込まれてしまう。姿の見えないサオリ、生存者を襲う謎の生物、果たして番場は…!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hUVpDrcjAEaMEi2mNpVW3B9Ll4q.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"88682","synopsis":"番場は、とある植物園で起こった事件の事情聴取に同席していた。唯一の生存者が淡々と話す不可解な経緯。番場は自らが追う奇獣が関係していることを直感する…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lBEU2MpfQg9jGfiKJGUEpB9X2q0.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"88683","synopsis":"番場は老婆から古い体験談を聞いていた。とある漁村に突如現れた奇獣・影鰐。村に犠牲者が出たことから村長は漁に出ることを禁ずる。しかし漁師の町蔵は娘の薬代のため、たった一人で禁じられた漁に出ようとするが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kFbvUESDn0a2Hnm1tCgMaSRzKLa.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300106","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"88684","synopsis":"25年前。少年だった番場は、父親に怒られ、家の蔵に閉じ込められていた。窓外に広がるのどかな景色。しかしその平和な時は、突如現れたある黒い影によって、跡形もなく破壊されてしまったのだった…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6gZ7m4o1ZqwX2nYMKxpkjKxAwXz.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11173","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21225","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30524","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66115","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show